{"id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-field.md","title":"Field","display":"df-field — Field","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-field","aliases":["58-df-field","Field"],"display":"df-field — Field","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-field"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-field</span><span>Field</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-field — Field"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1c30d21ea7b443f6\" href=\"?note=1c30d21ea7b443f6\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-ring.md\">../batch11/58-df-ring.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,+,\\cdot,0_F,1_F\\in V\">\\(F,+,\\cdot,0_F,1_F\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S\\)</span> (commutative-ring predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1c30d21ea7b443f6\" href=\"?note=1c30d21ea7b443f6\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-ring.md\">../batch11/58-df-ring.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Field}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Field}_S\\)</span> (field predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}field} \\vdash \\mathrm{Field}_S(F,+,\\cdot,0_F,1_F)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(F,+,\\cdot,0_F,1_F)\\land 0_F\\neq1_F\\land\\forall a\\in F\\setminus\\{0_F\\}\\;\\exists b\\in F\\;(a\\cdot b=1_F)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}field} \\vdash \\mathrm{Field}_S(F,+,\\cdot,0_F,1_F)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(F,+,\\cdot,0_F,1_F)\\land 0_F\\neq1_F\\land\\forall a\\in F\\setminus\\{0_F\\}\\;\\exists b\\in F\\;(a\\cdot b=1_F)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}field\\text{-}implicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{Field}_S(F,+,\\cdot)\\leftrightarrow\\exists 0_F,1_F\\in F\\;\\mathrm{Field}_S(F,+,\\cdot,0_F,1_F)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}field\\text{-}implicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{Field}_S(F,+,\\cdot)\\leftrightarrow\\exists 0_F,1_F\\in F\\;\\mathrm{Field}_S(F,+,\\cdot,0_F,1_F)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}field\\text{-}carrier} \\vdash \\mathrm{Field}_S(F)\\leftrightarrow\\exists +,\\cdot,0_F,1_F\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Field}_S(F,+,\\cdot,0_F,1_F)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}field\\text{-}carrier} \\vdash \\mathrm{Field}_S(F)\\leftrightarrow\\exists +,\\cdot,0_F,1_F\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Field}_S(F,+,\\cdot,0_F,1_F)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The three-argument compatibility form existentially binds the omitted zero and unit instead of leaving them free.</li>\n<li>Field: commutative ring where nonzero elements form group under multiplication.</li>\n<li>Standard examples include <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{Q}\\subseteq\\mathbb{R}\\subseteq\\mathbb{C}\">\\(\\mathbb{Q}\\subseteq\\mathbb{R}\\subseteq\\mathbb{C}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The characteristic fact <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Char}(F)=0\">\\(\\mathrm{Char}(F)=0\\)</span> or prime is a theorem about fields, not part of this defining clause.</li>\n<li>Finite fields: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{F}_q\">\\(\\mathbb{F}_q\\)</span> exists for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q = p^n\">\\(q = p^n\\)</span></li>\n<li>Algebraic closure: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar{F}\">\\(\\bar{F}\\)</span> exists for any field <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span></li>\n<li>Ordered field: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{R}\">\\(\\mathbb{R}\\)</span> is complete ordered field</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Dummit and Foote, Abstract Algebra</li>\n<li>Lang, Algebra</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-ring.md","status":"resolved","id":"1c30d21ea7b443f6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-ring.md","status":"resolved","id":"1c30d21ea7b443f6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S$ (commutative-ring predicate, see [[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F,+,\\cdot,0_F,1_F\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Field}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}field} \\vdash \\mathrm{Field}_S(F,+,\\cdot,0_F,1_F)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(F,+,\\cdot,0_F,1_F)\\land 0_F\\neq1_F\\land\\forall a\\in F\\setminus\\{0_F\\}\\;\\exists b\\in F\\;(a\\cdot b=1_F)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}field\\text{-}implicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{Field}_S(F,+,\\cdot)\\leftrightarrow\\exists 0_F,1_F\\in F\\;\\mathrm{Field}_S(F,+,\\cdot,0_F,1_F)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}field\\text{-}carrier} \\vdash \\mathrm{Field}_S(F)\\leftrightarrow\\exists +,\\cdot,0_F,1_F\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Field}_S(F,+,\\cdot,0_F,1_F)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb{Q}\\subseteq\\mathbb{R}\\subseteq\\mathbb{C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Char}(F)=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{F}_q","display":false},{"tex":"q = p^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar{F}","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{R}","display":false}],"bytes":1600,"backlinks":[{"id":"af0349c490d72a92","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Field}_S$ (field-structure predicate, see [[../batch13/58-df-field.md]])"},{"id":"07ee726a6e15b274","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05b5dba2baae641d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)$ (explicit scalar field, see [[../batch13/58-df-field.md]])"},{"id":"80c210450e512314","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Field}_S$ (field predicate; see [[../batch13/58-df-field.md]])"},{"id":"37336284b6cfdfa6","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a5ba2702c21f0a09","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbb K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}$ 且 $\\mathrm{Field}_S(\\mathbb K,+_{\\mathbb K},\\cdot_{\\mathbb K})$（see [[../batch13/58-df-field.md]]）"},{"id":"004e048b3416923c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"71b29ecf4e6d3eb0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)$ (see [[58-df-field]])"},{"id":"e919bc05b2851392","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$K,L,+_L,\\cdot_L,0_L,1_L,P_K\\in V$ (see [[58-df-field]])"},{"id":"5faf0467ca9c794e","ancho